  "description": "A-601's Tuesday 90 is the evidence that fulfils an expectation and nothing references it. Removing it would change the expectation's fulfillment, so the plan is refused and the entry kept. When it is instead corrected (the source said 60), the correction removes it as evidence at every cutoff and the expectation is outstanding again.",
